    "content": "<div class=\"main-content\">\n<div class=\"dita\">\n<div class=\"topic section\">\n<div class=\"topic topic concept\" id=\"GUID-7664A328-DFB5-4A16-BCDE-CCAFCFC817E0-en\" lang=\"en\">\n<h1 class=\"title\" id=\"GUID-7664A328-DFB5-4A16-BCDE-CCAFCFC817E0-en_id-79403ef1-99f8-4211-fed7-b921a539c73c\"><div>\n<span class=\"ph\" id=\"GUID-7664A328-DFB5-4A16-BCDE-CCAFCFC817E0-en_id-38a84dab-db89-4988-ee9b-0471c6562ee4\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vSphere Lifecycle Manager</div></span> and <span class=\"ph\" id=\"GUID-7664A328-DFB5-4A16-BCDE-CCAFCFC817E0-en_id-f23c6d2e-77e3-45d0-ede7-3c5634748b50\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vSphere Supervisor</div></span></div></h1>\n<div class=\"shortdesc\" id=\"GUID-7664A328-DFB5-4A16-BCDE-CCAFCFC817E0-en_id-090439e2-002d-4601-b178-8fcbd0e5d030\"><div>You can enable <span class=\"ph\" id=\"GUID-7664A328-DFB5-4A16-BCDE-CCAFCFC817E0-en_id-4103442c-953b-4a96-ddf8-b8e0d842e617\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vSphere Supervisor</div></span> on vSphere clusters that you manage with a single <span class=\"ph\" id=\"GUID-7664A328-DFB5-4A16-BCDE-CCAFCFC817E0-en_id-015a6cc8-8cb3-493d-8360-410020f7d063\"><div style=\"display: inline;\">vSphere Lifecycle Manager</div></span> image. </div></div>\n<div></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
    "url": "https://techdocs.broadcom.com/us/en/vmware-cis/vsphere/vsphere/8-0/managing-host-and-cluster-lifecycle/vsphere-lifecycle-manager-and-other-vmware-products-and-solutions/vsphere-lifecycle-manager-and-vsphere-with-tanzu.html",
